---
description: Bind each object interpretation to provenance, loan status, community restrictions and conservation evidence.
args: { dossier: ExhibitionDossier; change: ExhibitionChange }
returns: ObjectConstraint[]
---
For each artifact, preserve supported interpretation and provenance limits. Join current loan, community and conservation sources to the artifact ID. Distinguish a loan withdrawal from a change in evidentiary quality. Apply display restrictions to physical and digital derivatives. Missing or conflicting permission remains a release blocker.
